Q)Sum of arrray using recursive 
------------------------------
l1=[10,20,30,40,50]
def sumArr(l1):
    if len(l1)==0:
        return 0
    return l1[0]+sumArr(l1[1:])
    
print(sumArr(l1))

output-150
